Breaks: A chat that goes away mid-call is told that another agent is using the mailbox and did not let go in time. Nobody is holding anything, so whoever reads that — a log, a person — goes looking for a problem that is not there.
Must fail: go test ./internal/mailbox -run '^TestACancelledWaitStopsAndIsNotAFailure$' -count=1

